I close the door after Nina.
I am completely finished with screens for tonight.
I put my phone in the charger.
It usually lies on the sofa, but now it needs to charge.
Tomorrow is Wednesday.
I usually work out at the gym on Wednesday evening.
My own little rule is that the sports bag is packed the night before.
First, the bag is fetched from the closet in the hallway.
Then my shoes are put down into it.
I also find my water bottle out in the kitchen.
It is carefully placed next to the shoes.
I always usually bring clean clothes.
The clothes are also put down into the bag.
I check that I have everything.
Finally, the bag is placed ready by the front door.
That way, it is not forgotten tomorrow morning.
Now all my practical tasks are solved for today.
I am just looking forward to a quiet evening.
